        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Now Selling - 2 bedroom own door ground floor apartment approx. 83 sq.m / 893 sq.ft from €380,000.\r\n\r\nMarmion Walk is a quality housing development situated within walking distance of everything the thriving town of Clane has to offer.  This riverside town is a family favourite and has all amenities needed to enjoy life to the fullest.  The 2, 3 and 4-bed homes in the development meet the needs of families of every size.  Each 'A' rated property is exceptional throughout with stylish bathrooms, quality kitchens and spacious layouts on offer.  Designed with care and consideration, Westin Homes give comfortable, contemporary homes to every new owner."
